{"seq":2,"slug":"inner-loop-fast-feedback","title":"内循环与快速反馈","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/developer-experience-engineering/inner-loop-fast-feedback","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"fast-local-feedback-loops","title":"快速的本地反馈循环","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/developer-experience-engineering/inner-loop-fast-feedback/fast-local-feedback-loops","wordCount":2756,"readingTime":12},{"seq":2,"slug":"reproducible-dev-environments","title":"可复现的开发环境","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/developer-experience-engineering/inner-loop-fast-feedback/reproducible-dev-environments","wordCount":2921,"readingTime":12},{"seq":3,"slug":"local-vs-remote-development","title":"本地与远程开发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/developer-experience-engineering/inner-loop-fast-feedback/local-vs-remote-development","wordCount":2807,"readingTime":12}],"introMarkdown":"# 内循环与快速反馈 简介\n\n开发者一天里重复最多的，是**内循环**——改代码、构建、运行、看结果，再改。这个循环的快慢，几乎决定了开发的爽感与效率。本章聚焦优化内循环：先讲**快速的本地反馈循环**（为什么构建/测试/热重载的速度是 DX 的核心，几秒和几分钟的天壤之别），然后是**可复现的开发环境**（用 devcontainer/Nix/Docker 让每个人的环境一致，消除「在我机器上能跑」），最后是**本地与远程开发**（remote dev、Codespaces 等何时用、各自的取舍）。优化内循环，是 DX 投入回报最高的地方——因为它乘以了开发者每天重复它的次数。\n"}